      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Why it works",
      "items": [
        "SQL looks for exact values: “feline” doesn't find “cat”",
        "The embedding captures MEANING: similar texts end up close together",
        "The Vector DB answers: “which are the nearest?”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Indexing (offline)",
      "items": [
        "Documents are split into chunks and turned into vectors once",
